"""Organic objectives for the articulations of the ACS organic content map (2013) that no Library objective answered,
plus the depth Kevin asked for: physical organic chemistry (conformational equilibria, kinetic and thermodynamic
control, rate laws as mechanism clues, radical energetics and selectivity, the Hammett equation, pericyclic selection
rules), organometallic reagents and Pd catalysis, and arrow pushing. Numeric keys are recomputed by sympy; selection
rules are checked by rule (4n / 4n + 2 counting); facts are authored at the level of a two-semester course."""
from opl_dsl import Q

FILE, FRAMEWORK = "or-accm", "organic-reactions"
MC = ["{{o1}}", "{{o2}}", "{{o3}}", "{{o4}}"]
